KPL/IK

ORX OTES Instrument Kernel
===============================================================================

   This Instrument Kernel (IK) file contains Field-Of-View (FOV) and
   other geometric parameters definitions for the OSIRIS-REx Thermal
   Emission Spectrometer (OTES) instrument.


Version and Date
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

   Version 0.0 -- August 24, 2015 -- Boris Semenov, NAIF

      Placeholder version.


